# Zhou et al. (2026) Sec. 3.2 (2-D) and 3.6 (3-D): natural convection in a
# differentially heated cavity, Pr = 0.71, hot x=0 / cold x=L, every other
# wall adiabatic and no-slip. M3LB D3Q27 fluid + D3Q7 BGK temperature,
# midway wall family, Esoteric Pull, FP64.
# Velocities scaled by alpha/H; extrema taken on the z = L/2 plane.
# de Vahl Davis (1983), Richardson-extrapolated:
