#   Ra=1e6  Nu=8.800  u*max=64.63@0.850  v*max=219.36@0.0379
# Nu_hot and Nu_cold are equal identically -- the configuration is
# centro-symmetric -- so Nu_vol = 1 + <u_x theta> H/alpha is the
# independent estimator, and <u_x>H/alpha must be ~0 for it to hold.
